emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果计划12月在华推出Apple Intelligence，百度与阿里提供技术支持</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">上海人工智能实验室依托书生科学多模态大模型破解三维Ghys猜想</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek发布服务补偿通知：将按账号7日内消耗金额全额返还赠金</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阶跃星辰开源Step 5 Preview模型权重，支持百万上下文与MoE架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d6b3ddd4e3925de598c1d224d1efc304.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阶跃星辰正式开源Step 5 Preview模型权重，同步向全球开发者提供BF16与FP8版本权重、技术博客及配套开发工具。该模型采用稀疏MoE架构，总参数量600B，单token激活参数为27B，在保持高效推理的同时，原生支持文本与视觉多模态输入，并具备100万token超长上下文窗口，专为长程复杂Agent任务优化。此前，该模型在OpenRouter调用量排名中曾位居全球第二。目前，模型权重已上线Hugging Face与ModelScope平台，适配主流芯片与推理框架，支持本地部署及离线推理。阶跃星辰通过公开架构设计与训练协同优化细节，旨在降低开发者构建先进智能应用的门槛，加速大模型在垂直与长程应用场景的落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁百灵开源Ling-3.1-flash模型：560B参数部署降至4卡，支持1M上下文</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/eaf5f8b239f734453aabfbec86083720.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">10月15日，蚂蚁集团百灵大模型正式开源Ling-3.1-flash。该模型采用混合线性架构，总参数量约560B，激活参数约25B，最高支持1M上下文。在性能方面，模型在办公、医疗、软件工程及终端操作等复杂工作流中表现优异，在GDPVal-AA V2.1评测中获得1673分（ELO），HealthBench Professional得分65.35。针对部署优化，团队通过对routed experts采用MXFP4量化及dense层保持block-FP8，将权重占用从约534GB降至292GB，使Hopper GPU环境下的服务部署需求从8卡降至4卡。该模型主打“智效比”，在Artificial Analysis评测中智能指数达41，输出速度约210 Token/s，混合调用价格约为0.19美元/百万Token。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果计划12月在华推出Apple Intelligence，百度与阿里提供技术支持</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a56476344ae1e88b3abd29f84eb89018.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果计划于今年12月通过iOS 27.3系统更新，正式在中国大陆推出Apple Intelligence。首批上线功能涵盖iPhone、iPad与Mac的基础AI服务，但今年全新改版的Siri AI助手暂不包含在内。该服务已于7月完成生成式AI服务备案，并于9月29日获得上线许可。在技术合作方面，百度将负责搜索及视觉智能功能，iOS 27 Beta 2固件中已出现“Baidu Visual Search”模块。阿里则作为模型底座提供方，其通义万相与Qwen模型将集成至iOS、iPadOS、macOS及visionOS，支持文本理解、图像生成与内容创作。Apple Intelligence架构由端侧30亿参数模型与云端高性能模型组成，此次通过接入本土大模型与搜索能力，苹果旨在确保国行用户获得合规且完整的系统AI体</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">上海人工智能实验室依托书生科学多模态大模型破解三维Ghys猜想</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">上海人工智能实验室访问学者许地生团队近日利用“书生科学多模态大模型 S2”（书生-S2），成功破解了困扰数学界长达30年的世界级难题——三维 Ghys 猜想。这是中国科学家首次利用国产大模型攻克世界级数学难题。该研究采用“通专融合”技术路径，通过人机协同完成证明，并由北京大学董彬教授、刘若川院士团队利用自主开发的 SHEAF 框架进行形式化验证，确凿证实了成果的正确性。三维 Ghys 猜想由法国数学家 Étienne Ghys 于1995年提出，涉及紧致复流形上的全纯 Anosov 系统，是检验 AI 数学推理能力的试金石。此次突破不仅展现了国产大模型在尖端科学计算与复杂逻辑推理方面的潜力，也为人工智能深度赋能基础科学研究提供了全新的实践路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek发布服务补偿通知：将按账号7日内消耗金额全额返还赠金</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a325057d23ea1649de77e544020d4b15.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek官方开放平台于10月15日发布公告，针对当日8:11至13:04期间发生的API服务故障进行全额补偿。此次故障导致该时段内API服务无法正常使用，平台已完成系统全面排查与整改，通过剥离单点依赖以提升服务稳定性。作为补偿方案，DeepSeek将按用户账号在10月8日至10月14日期间的API消耗金额，以赠金形式全额返还。该赠金将自动发放至用户账户，后续API计费将优先扣除赠金。此次大额补偿机制体现了DeepSeek对开发者生态的重视，同时也为AI大模型厂商在基础设施韧性建设与服务保障方面树立了行业参考标准。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
